                <pb facs="0272" n="184" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg184"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that the United States Government accepts the proposal of the
                    Chinese Government concerning the payment of the indemnity, subject to the
                    conditions set forth in Department’s telegram of the 6th instant.)</p>
            </div>
